  "description": "About the Opportunity Embark on the AI Skill Sprint, an exciting online coding challenge hosted by Chandigarh University. This event is designed for teams eager to dive deep into the world of artificial intelligence and demonstrate their innovative solutions. Prepare to push your coding boundaries in this dynamic online environment. The AI Skill Sprint offers a unique platform to collaborate, problem-solve, and gain recognition for your team's technical expertise in AI. Themes Artificial Intelligence Machine Learning Computer Vision Eligibility and Registration Open to teams from all colleges Team size: min 1, max 4 Round 1 (online) registration: free Registration closes: September 20 Competition Structure Round 1 — Online (Sep 20-21): All registered teams compete in the online AI quiz, coding challenge Results (Sep 22): Top 50 teams announced. Notified with instructions to pay ₹200 registration fee for Round 2 Round 2 — Offline (Sep 25): Shortlisted teams (post-fee payment) attend the final round at Chandigarh University campus. Participants will be assessed on their knowledge and practical skills in Machine Learning and Computer Vision , focusing on core concepts, and real-world applications. Prizes & Perks Exciting Prize Pool: Attractive cash prizes and goodies for winning teams. Finalist Rewards: Trophies, exclusive swags, and certificates for all finalists.",
