    "details": "<p><strong>About the Opportunity</strong></p>\n<p>Embark on the AI Skill Sprint, an exciting online coding challenge hosted by Chandigarh University. This event is designed for teams eager to dive deep into the world of artificial intelligence and demonstrate their innovative solutions.</p>\n<p>Prepare to push your coding boundaries in this dynamic online environment. The AI Skill Sprint offers a unique platform to collaborate, problem-solve, and gain recognition for your team's technical expertise in AI.</p>\n<p><strong>Themes</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"691\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1qfianv\" data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"654\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"d3mavt\" data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"673\">Machine Learning</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"f79kq3\" data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"691\">Computer Vision</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility and Registration</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"864\">\n<li data-section-id=\"o01buu\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"760\">Open to teams from all colleges</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jgfu7x\" data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"786\">Team size: min 1, max 4</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"13il556\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"824\">Round 1 (online) registration: free</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pi9wi1\" data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"864\">Registration closes: <strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"864\">September 20</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Competition Structure</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1414\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1pidayd\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"994\"><strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"925\">Round 1 &mdash; Online (Sep 20-21):</strong> All registered teams compete in the online AI quiz, coding challenge</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"oqzvwr\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1114\"><strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1018\">Results (Sep 22):</strong> Top 50 teams announced. Notified with instructions to pay <strong data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1085\">₹200</strong> registration fee for Round 2</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"17cxo5m\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1241\"><strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1148\">Round 2 &mdash; Offline (Sep 25):</strong> Shortlisted teams (post-fee payment) attend the final round at Chandigarh University campus.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14p1o6p\" data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1414\">Participants will be assessed on their knowledge and practical skills in <strong data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1357\">Machine Learning and Computer Vision</strong>, focusing on core concepts, and real-world applications.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Prizes &amp; Perks</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1603\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1s9j9oq\" data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1516\"><strong data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1462\">Exciting Prize Pool:</strong> Attractive cash prizes and goodies for winning teams.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"603qy5\" data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1603\"><strong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1540\">Finalist Rewards:</strong> Trophies, exclusive swags, and certificates for all finalists.</li>\n</ul>",
    "end_date": "2026-09-25T16:30:00+05:30",
